---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Coursework
description: Notable coursework across CS courses at UC San Diego.
permalink: /coursework/
---
<h1>Coursework</h1>
<p>
  A selection of notable coursework from my CS courses at UC San Diego.
  Each course page contains brief write-ups of assignments and links to code on GitHub.
</p>

<ul class="card-list">
  {% for course in courses %}
    <li class="card">
      <h2><a href="/coursework/{{ course.slug }}/">{{ course.code }} — {{ course.name }}</a></h2>
      <p class="lede">{{ course.area }}</p>
      <p>{{ course.summary }}</p>
    </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>
